These outputs come from small textbook jobs (water, formaldehyde, methanol, benzene,
oxygen) run with GAMESS 2024 R2 for this plugin's tests. tools/sanitize_gamess_log.py
removed the run script, paths, host names, dates, timings and the acknowledgement
list; tests/test_fixture_privacy.py holds every file to that. The inputs are
reproducible from the input echo at the top of each file.
